Package: adaptation-realme-rmx2001
Version: 1.0.0
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: RMX2001 Droidian Maintainers <noreply@localhost>
Depends: bluebinder, systemd
Replaces: bluebinder
Recommends: modemmanager
Description: Device adaptation for the Realme 6 (RMX2001) Droidian port
 Applies every device-specific fix accumulated during this port's
 bring-up: removes the unregistered camera provider HAL from the VINTF
 manifest, fixes a POSIX-sh bashism in bluebinder's address-lookup
 script and makes its missing-address failure non-fatal, ranks the
 broken droidvdec/droidadec GStreamer decoders below the working
 hardware/software ones, permanently disables cellular (ofono,
 ModemManager, mmsd-tng, calls-daemon - this device never has a SIM),
 and installs the server-mode headless/phone toggle.
 .
 See helpers/DEVICE-PROVISIONING.md in the kernel source repository for
 the full rationale and investigation behind each fix.
